# Golden-file regression case: 2D SCFT of a symmetric A/B homopolymer blend,
# adapted from examples/ft/input (updated to the current parser syntax:
# "molecule linear phi ...", no in-box maxSteps, top-level "run nvt").
# Grid reduced 125^2 -> 48^2 to keep the golden files small; 200 steps is
# enough to exercise the Helfand+Flory update path well past initialization.
box fts scft
Dim 2
grid 48 48
boxLengths 20.0 20.0
species A
species B
Nr 50
rho0 50

molecule linear phi 0.5 1 25 A smear Gaussian 0.15
molecule linear phi 0.5 1 25 B

potential Helfand 50.0 0.1 modify zeromean updateScheme 1S
potential Flory A B 2.9 0.1 0.01 initialize sin 0 0.2 1.0 updateScheme 1S

logFreq 50
chemFieldFreq 100
densityFieldFreq 100
endBox

run nvt 200
